  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "A plain brooch of grey iron shaped as a rayed star, the clasp a wandering Ranger pins his cloak with. Halbarad gives it to those he sets upon the uncrowned path -- the grey road of the Rangers of the North, who guard the sleeping lands unthanked. It is no Elendilmir, only the mark of a watch begun. Only a ranger may wear it."
    }
  },
  "Description": {
